Short:        Rename multiple files
Author:       Uwe Rosner
Uploader:     u.rosner@ymail.com (Uwe Rosner)
Type:         util/misc
Version:      1.0
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.2.3
Distribution: Aminet


=====
ABOUT
=====

MultiRename is a tool for renaming multiple input files and directories
according to a user defined pattern. It is inspired by the MultiRename tool of
TotalCommander (Windows), but does not yet have all of its functions.

To run it an Amiga with AmigaOS 3.2.3 (!) is needed: MultiRename uses BOOPSI
objects (Reaction) and needs a recently updated function of 'string.gadget'
which was released in the 3.2.3 update in April 2025.

